  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:07.760" end="00:11.760" ttm:agent="v1">I'm like, &quot;My, oh, my, baby, this my kinda night&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:11.760" end="00:15.910" ttm:agent="v1">Flashin' lights up on my body, feels like '90s paparazzi</p>
      <p begin="00:15.910" end="00:19.990" ttm:agent="v1">I'm like, &quot;My, oh, my, baby, this my kinda night&quot;</p>
      <p begin="00:19.990" end="00:25.310" ttm:agent="v1">Strangers dancin' all around me, it's like straight out of a movie</p>
      <p begin="00:25.310" end="00:33.310" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="00:36.230" end="00:40.720" ttm:agent="v1">Flashin' lights up on my body, feels like '90s paparazzi</p>
      <p begin="00:40.720" end="00:45.070" ttm:agent="v1">Retro glamorous, modern fabulous, point your cameras, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:45.070" end="00:49.220" ttm:agent="v1">Giving MTV, Bella and Gigi, sippin' on Clicquot, oh, oh</p>
      <p begin="00:49.220" end="00:52.330" ttm:agent="v1">Real big energy, radiate outta me, baby, just look at me</p>
      <p begin="00:52.330" end="00:56.840" ttm:agent="v1">Look at me, look at me go, whoa-oh</p>
      <p begin="00:56.840" end="01:00.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'm like, &quot;My, oh, my, baby, this my kinda night&quot; (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:00.930" end="01:05.100" ttm:agent="v1">Flashin' lights up on my body, feels like '90s paparazzi</p>
      <p begin="01:05.100" end="01:09.190" ttm:agent="v1">I'm like, &quot;My, oh, my, baby, this my kinda night&quot;</p>
      <p begin="01:09.190" end="01:14.520" ttm:agent="v1">Strangers dancin' all around me, it's like straight out of a movie</p>
      <p begin="01:14.520" end="01:22.520" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:30.390" end="01:34.960" ttm:agent="v1">I run the table like it's Vegas, I'm like Charlie with these angels</p>
      <p begin="01:34.960" end="01:38.660" ttm:agent="v1">Taking pictures, feeling famous, oh</p>
      <p begin="01:38.660" end="01:42.630" ttm:agent="v1">I feel so Kim and Khloé, ain't no Photoshop, Adobe</p>
      <p begin="01:42.630" end="01:46.940" ttm:agent="v1">Walk in like I am Naomi, o-o-oh</p>
      <p begin="01:46.940" end="01:49.140" ttm:agent="v1">When I walk in</p>
      <p begin="01:49.140" end="01:51.120" ttm:agent="v1">It's electric</p>
      <p begin="01:51.120" end="01:52.770" ttm:agent="v1">Roll the carpet for me</p>
      <p begin="01:52.770" end="01:56.480" ttm:agent="v1">One more time</p>
      <p begin="01:56.480" end="02:00.300" ttm:agent="v1">I'm like, &quot;My, oh, my, baby, this my kinda night&quot;</p>
      <p begin="02:00.300" end="02:04.640" ttm:agent="v1">Flashin' lights up on my body, feels like '90s paparazzi</p>
